      "Welcome to the world of 'PristonTale.'",
      "You are currently in Ricarten, a town located in the ",
      "southern part of the Priston land. In Ricarten, you can ",
      "find blacksmith's and mini shops where you can purchase ",
      "hunting equipments and other necessary items. ",
      "This is a good place for novice players. ",
      "Please take time to look around and talk",
      "to other folks here."
